      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '1) AI COMPANION PROTOTYPE

    Locate the small, rounded autonomous unit.
    Its neural processor is required to assist you to unlock the doors.


    2)
    SIGNAL MODULATOR

    Acquire the handheld button array capable of transmitting
    frequencies. It controls the laboratory''s primary viewing screen.


    3) FIELD
    OPTIC SENSOR

    Retrieve the compact, ruggedized black cube with a high-definitions
    lens. We need its visual logs to analyze the parasite.


    4) INTERFACE NAVIGATOR

    Secure
    the palm-sized peripheral resting on a flat surface. It translates physical motion
    into digital cursor coordinates.


    5) KINETIC LAUNCHER

    Locate the handheld
    device with a grip and trigger mechanism. It is designed for "Battle Striker"
    rotational combat simulations.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b574a1e1729119c4f811ba54c3f7a240, type: 2}
